AArch64 MP+dmb.st+ptrs
"As MP+ptrs, with DMB ST before each publication: the address dependency orders the reader"
{ 0:X1=a; 0:X2=p; 0:X3=b; 1:X1=p; }
 P0          | P1           ;
 MOV X0,#1   | LDR X0,[X1]  ;
 STR X0,[X1] | CBZ X0,L0    ;
 DMB ST      | LDR X2,[X0]  ;
 STR X1,[X2] | L0:          ;
 STR X0,[X3] |              ;
 DMB ST      |              ;
 STR X3,[X2] |              ;
exists (1:X0=a /\ 1:X2=0 \/ 1:X0=b /\ 1:X2=0)
